683	{
684	  // Every abstract register write (write_register_abstract) busy-polls
685	  // abstractcs before returning, so by the time any caller inspects cmderr
686	  // the busy bit is already clear. Pin that contract: between each kCommand
687	  // write and the next, the recorded ops must include at least one
688	  // kAbstractcs read (the busy poll). A refactor that drops the chained poll
689	  // regresses this test.
